==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Inflation: Uber Rare}}

==Battleground==
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien Elite]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Dober]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**4 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Attempt to stall the first 5 small units using tanks such as [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], or [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]]. During this stall try to build up a stack of CC units, such as [[Juliet Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Juliet cat]]. A sniper item can help to to push back the Gories and allow the dober to be frozen.

Ubers that can control Angels are useful here, such as [[Momotaro (Uber Rare Cat)|The Peach Devils]]. Try to save to spawn Ubers and other long range AoE units until after the Dober is properly stalled, otherwise the Surge Attacks will kill most of the attackers.

